{"timestamp": 1778653345.7008774, "duration_sec": 2.2720742225646973, "validator_hotkey": "5GQyFzvtVMw9X45t6dvUFgR9unFpDCccPPCiAoqJrtPuC8my", "task_type": "conversation_tagging", "task_raw": {"mode": "mainnet", "api_version": 2.1, "guid": "HIDDEN", "bundle_guid": "HIDDEN", "type": "conversation_tagging", "scoring_mechanism": "ground_truth_tag_similarity_scoring", "input": {"guid": "HIDDEN", "input_type": "conversation", "data": {"window_idx": -1, "window": [[0, "P\u00e1n Machala to m\u00e1 tak dos\u0165 z\u00e1sadne popleten\u00e9, lebo on si st\u00e1le nevedomuje, \u017ee on je \u0161t\u00e1tny \u00faradn\u00edk, ktor\u00fd sa m\u00e1 riadi\u0165 z\u00e1konom. A \u0161t\u00e1tny \u00faradn\u00edk m\u00e1 p\u00f4sobi\u0165 ako s\u00fadca. On nem\u00e1 \u010do politicky rozpr\u00e1va\u0165. On to st\u00e1le nepochopil. On tvrd\u00ed, \u017ee to je jeho \u00fastavn\u00e9 pr\u00e1vo, ale jeho \u00fastavn\u00e9 pr\u00e1vo nie je potom by\u0165 t\u00fdm \u0161t\u00e1tnym \u00faradn\u00edkom. Ale tro\u0161ku som odbo\u010dil. Budem zase citova\u0165. Tiche oslobodzenie \u0161t\u00e1tnych m\u00faze\u00ed mimo rozhortu kult\u00fary."], [0, "Nara\u017eate na to, \u017ee vlastne, alebo teda platforma, \u017ee popri 27 m\u00faze\u00e1ch p\u00f4sobnosti Ministerstva kult\u00fary, e\u0161te tu m\u00e1me 15 \u0161t\u00e1tnych m\u00faze\u00ed z p\u00f4sobnosti in\u00fdch rezortov. A citujem, ich person\u00e1lne finan\u010dn\u00e9 zabezpe\u010denie je v ruk\u00e1ch ministerstvia, ktor\u00fdch hlavn\u00fa \u00falahu nie je starostlivos\u0165 a kult\u00farne dedictvo. A tieto m\u00fazea dnes dopl\u00e1caj\u00fa na konsolid\u00e1ciu. Prep\u00fa\u0161\u0165aj\u00fa sa odborn\u00ed zamestnanci,"], [0, "po otichu, bez ve\u013ekej pozornosti, nejde o hromadn\u00e9 prep\u00fa\u0161\u0165anie a t\u00fdm p\u00e1dom vlastne to zost\u00e1va mimoverejnej debaty. \u010ci\u017ee pokra\u010duje to, \u010do sme videli hne\u010f po n\u00e1stupe, kde to ste boli vy, to boli proste \u0161efovia TANAPu a \u010fal\u0161\u00edch fil\u00fa n\u00e1rodn\u00fdch parkov, to bol \u0161\u00e9fka Slovenskej n\u00e1rodnej gal\u00e9rie, Slovenskeho n\u00e1rodn\u00e9ho m\u00fazea, Slovenske n\u00e1rodn\u00e9 divadlo a tak \u010falej, \u017ee si tam dosaduj\u00fa sebevern\u00fdch a lojaln\u00fdch."], [0, "Len pod\u013ea m\u0148a najsmutnej\u0161ie na tomto celom je, ani nie to, \u017ee sme i\u0161li my ako \u0161tatut\u00e1ri a \u0161tatut\u00e1rky, lebo ja si mysl\u00edm, \u017ee ka\u017ed\u00fd \u0161tatut\u00e1r proste... Je n\u00e1hradite\u013en\u00fd. Je n\u00e1hradite\u013en\u00fd a aj proste si mus\u00ed po\u010d\u00edta\u0165. A v takomto na\u0161om balk\u00e1nskom syst\u00e9me, ktor\u00fd m\u00e1me na Slovensku, jednoducho mus\u00edme tak tro\u0161ku s t\u00fdm po\u010d\u00edta\u0165. Neboli sme prv\u00ed ani posledn\u00ed. Stra\u0161te na tom bola ten rozsah, \u017ee to naozaj ne\u0161lo..."], [0, "jednotlivcovali, \u017ee sa to pav\u0161alne vlastne nejak\u00fdm tak\u00fdmto sp\u00f4sobom rie\u0161ilo. Ale vlastne, \u010do m\u0148a najviac na tom nejak vyru\u0161uje, je to, \u017ee vlastne ten tak\u00fdto revan\u017eistick\u00fd nejak\u00fd pr\u00edstup sa dotkol aj be\u017en\u00fdch zamestnancov a zamestnankynie. \u017de naozaj odborn\u00edkov a odborn\u00ed\u010dek, ktor\u00ed si proste robili t\u00fa svoju kuratorsk\u00fa, k\u00fastock\u00fa alebo in\u00fa pr\u00e1cu a vlastne sa len napr\u00edklad vyjadrili na podporu"], [0, "t\u00fdch odiden\u00fdch proste \u0161t\u00e1tut\u00e1rov, alebo jednoducho za\u010dali kritizova\u0165 nejak\u00e9 kroky t\u00fdch dosaden\u00fdch. A nie je to z\u00e1mer vysla\u0165 ten sign\u00e1l vlastne celej spolo\u010dnosti, \u017ee nevytr\u010daj, pozn\u00e1m e\u0161te to z normaliz\u00e1cie Zah\u00fas\u00e1ka, nevytr\u010daj moc hlavu, lebo si ju zotn\u00fa, to mi hovorila e\u0161te moja mama Zah\u00fas\u00e1ka."], [0, "\u00c1no, a je to ve\u013emi smutn\u00e9, lebo my sme sa vlastne len u\u010dili za\u010da\u0165 vytr\u010da\u0165. Prepa\u010dte, ale ja si e\u0161te pam\u00e4t\u00e1m, to bola premi\u00e9rkou Iveta Radi\u010dov\u00e1, ke\u010f sa tu viedli v\u00e1\u0161nev\u00e9 diskusie na \u00farovni vl\u00e1dnej koal\u00edcie, \u017ee t\u00ed \u0161\u00e9fovia \u0161t\u00e1tnych podnikov, kde i\u0161lo teda aj o in\u00e9 peniaze a tak \u010falej, \u017ee u\u017e to nem\u00e1 by\u0165 nejak\u00fd politick\u00fd nominanti, ale maj\u00fa tam by\u0165 nejak\u00e9 tendre v\u00fdberov\u00e9 a tak \u010falej. Aj vo va\u0161om pr\u00edpade, vy ste pre\u0161li nejak\u00fdm tendrom, alebo teda nejak\u00fdm v\u00fdberom konkurzom,"], [0, "Teraz vid\u00edme, upozornili ste t\u00e1to, teraz mysl\u00edm v pr\u00edpade \u010cerven\u00e9ho kamenia, alebo mysl\u00edm Bojnic a tak \u010falej. Cel\u00e1 t\u00e1 sk\u00fasenos\u0165 hodila do ko\u0161a, alebo sa to rob\u00ed ako\u017ee na oko, lebo sa nie\u010do zverejnila, vlastne neviem, kto to tam je a na z\u00e1klade \u010do oboduj\u00fa a tak \u010falej. A stavuj\u00fa sa z toho trafiky pre \u0161ielik\u00fdch stranick\u00fdch fe\u0161akov tejto vl\u00e1dnej koal\u00edcie."], [0, "\u00c1no, v\u00fdznamn\u00e9 ve\u013ek\u00e9 in\u0161tit\u00facie, do ktor\u00fdch ide ve\u013ek\u00e9 mno\u017estvo financie, \u017ee ke\u010f sa to vlastne nazr\u00e1tava dohromady, \u017ee aj ke\u010f s\u00fa finan\u010dne teda podvy\u017eiven\u00e9 v skuto\u010dnosti, ale aj tak proste je to naozaj ako\u017ee ve\u013ek\u00e1 hodnota, ktor\u00e1 sa vlastne d\u00e1va v \u0161anc proste tak\u00fdmto \u013eu\u010fom. A \u00e1no, vlastne syst\u00e9m, ktor\u00fd sme si ledva vybudovali, \u017ee vlastne za\u010dali by\u0165 nejak\u00e9 aj v rezorte, teda Miesec a kult\u00fary,"], [0, "verejn\u00e9 v\u00fdberov\u00e9 konania, ktor\u00e9 vlastne mohli by\u0165 aj pod doh\u013eadom verejnosti, tak sa vlastne vraciame zase za nejak\u00e9 z\u00e1vret\u00e9 dvere. No, to nie je len o t\u00fdch peniazoch, ktor\u00e9 ste teraz spom\u00ednali, ale upozornila na to aj kuratorka pani Gregorov\u00e1 St\u00e1h z Slovsk\u00e9ho narodn\u00e9 gal\u00e9rie. Teraz op\u00e4\u0165 som zachy\u0165al tak\u00fd v tom pr\u00edpade hudobn\u00e9ho muzea, hudobn\u00e9ho instit\u00fatu vlastne v Bratislave."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["News & Politics"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["cultural heritage", "state museums", "ministry of culture", "public officials", "political influence", "staffing changes", "layoffs", "public institutions", "leadership appointments", "public procurement", "open competitions", "transparency", "nepotism", "freedom of speech", "constitutional law", "government reform", "workplace retaliation", "public administration"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
