is seeing minimal investment due to its aging industrial stock and reliance on port activity."], [2, "Seattle Real Estate Market Reports | Newmark\nEach quarter, Newmark\u2019s Seattle Washington Real Estate Market Report provides actionable data, insights and information for both the industrial and office real estate markets . The report outlines regional market opportunities and aids in business decision-making."], [3, "Seattle Warehouse Market: Industrial Real Estate Dynamics in ...\nIn this Q&A, Ryan discusses Seattle ' s consumption-driven market dynamics, submarket characteristics and the economic fundamentals that continue to drive long - term demand for warehouse space in thePacific Northwest."]], "participants": null}}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "ner_001", "crc": 1321322, "title": "Extract named entities from documents", "name": "extract_named_entities", "description": "Identifies and extracts named entities from provided documents.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "ner", "prompt_template": "Extract all named entities from the provided document. Include the following entity types: PERSON, ORGANIZATION, LOCATION, and any other relevant entities. Return as comma-delimited list of entities with their types (e.g., 'John Smith (PERSON), ACM Corp (ORGANIZATION)). Only return the entities without any additional commentary.", "output_variable": "extracted_entities", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["seattle city council", "land use and sustainability committee", "seattle city hall", "council chamber", "600 4th avenue seattle wa 98104", "councilmember eddie lin", "councilmember dionne foster", "councilmember joy hollingsworth", "councilmember alexis mercedes rinck", "councilmember maritza rivera", "councilmember dan strauss", "lylianna allala", "office of sustainability and environment", "port of seattle", "seattle industrial district mic", "duwam