ive years, I've been more so focused on the exciting world of Web3 with the current year focused on AI. I love being plugged into different accelerators, hackathons and demo days. And I volunteer as judge and mentor. Very, very happy to be here. What's your favorite thing about venture capital? Well, that would be..."], [0, "relate back to my parents. My parents are immigrants, so they immigrated to Canada. And I watched them create everything from very little or nothing. And that really made me have a lot of respect and awe for founders and entrepreneurs. And in my early careers, I've always worked with CSOs and founders. So I want to help more people and"], [0, "I'm very interested in venture capital because I will be in a very privileged position to help a portfolio of founders to help them change the world in a way. Yeah. Sophia, some of your content, some of your, your webinars, some of your blogs have got huge uptake, you know, being quoted by kind of major publications, you know, tell us a little bit more. I mean, you, you hit a chord on some stuff. What,"], [0, "What's that all about? What's been the cause of that? Tell us more. Yeah, for sure. It's really exciting times because I am looking to back amazing AI founders, looking to back amazing women leaders. So in our recent publication, the angle that we're focused on is women in AI."], [0, "And that seemed to be a very interesting topic resonating with our community as well as a greater community because it hits two important things. One is AI, which is all over the news right now. It's got a lot of breathless coverage. It exploded since November 2022 when ChatGPT burst into the world and also women founders. I mean, there's a lot of"]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["Technology"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["venture capital", "deep tech", "alumni ventures", "individual investors", "investment fund", "coinvesting", "artificial intelligence", "women in ai", "women founders", "entrepreneurship", "startups", "capital raising", "web3", "accelerators", "hackathons", "demo days", "mentorship", "financial inclusion", "immigration"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
