t of entities with their types (e.g., 'John Smith (PERSON), ACM Corp (ORGANIZATION)). Only return the entities without any additional commentary.", "output_variable": "extracted_entities", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["city council of the city of boston", "city of boston", "boston city hall", "christopher a. iannella chamber", "president louijeune", "councilor breadon", "councilor coletta zapata", "councilor durkan", "councilor fitzgerald", "councilor flynn", "councilor mejia", "councilor murphy", "councilor pep\u00e9n", "councilor santana", "councilor weber", "councilor worrell", "father federico cinocca", "emmanuel college", "community safety initiative", "massachusetts executive office of public safety and security", "office of workforce development", "message and order 1951", "agenda item 1951", "one hundred thousand dollars", "$100", "000.00"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
{"timestamp": 1778691340.5095038, "duration_sec": 3.9380204677581787, "validator_hotkey": "5GQyFzvtVMw9X45t6dvUFgR9unFpDCccPPCiAoqJrtPuC8my", "task_type": "conversation_tagging", "task_raw": {"mode": "mainnet", "api_version": 2.1, "guid": "HIDDEN", "bundle_guid": "HIDDEN", "type": "conversation_tagging", "scoring_mechanism": "ground_truth_tag_similarity_scoring", "input": {"guid": "HIDDEN", "input_type": "conversation", "data": {"window_idx": -1, "window": [[0, "Ja si mysl\u00edm, \u017ee na to mysl\u00edm ako\u017ee naozaj dos\u0165. Ja som teda aj \u0161tudovala fyzioterapiu a ako\u017ee ja ke\u010f som aj videla napr\u00edklad na praxi t\u00fdch \u013eud\u00ed, \u017ee \u010do napr\u00edklad stra\u0161ne dlho ni\u010d nerobili, necvi\u010dili, mne to pri\u0161lo ve\u013emi l\u00fato, \u017ee oni by mohli vzera\u0165 \u00faplne inak, keby mali nejak\u00fa t\u00fa prevenciu, \u017ee by napr\u00edklad..."], [0, "ke\u010f boli mlad\u00ed, cvi\u010dili, alebo samozrejme aj v dnesk\u00f4r\u0161om veku, v\u017edy sa d\u00e1 za\u010da\u0165, v\u017edy je to potrebn\u00e9, ale teda mysl\u00edm si, \u017ee ja db\u00e1m naozaj na to zdravie, aby st\u00e1le to... Db\u00e1\u0161 na to? \u00c1no, db\u00e1m na to, aby som proste bola zdrav\u00e1, aby mi to vydr\u017ealo a ako\u017ee samozrejme, je tam nejak\u00e9 progres\u00edvne pre\u0165a\u017eenie na t\u00fdch tr\u00e9ningoch, ale db\u00e1m hlavne na to, aby tie klby boli zdrav\u00e9, aby t\u00e1 technika bola dobr\u00e1."], [0, "\u010ci\u017ee, a kedy sa to asi tak zlomilo? \u017de si u\u017e myslela aj na t\u00fa starobu? Ale, lebo takto, tr\u00fafne si poveda\u0165, \u017ee v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ina z n\u00e1s, alebo teda..."], [0, "A ja som za\u010dal cvi\u010di\u0165 preto, aby som nejako lep\u0161ie vyzeral, preto\u017ee u\u017e sa mi robila ladvinka pod tri\u010dkom, aj ke\u010f som ju tam nemal. Za\u010dne v\u00e4\u010d\u0161ina \u013eud\u00ed cvi\u010di\u0165 hlavne kv\u00f4li tomu v\u00fdzoru. Neviem, ako to bolo u teba, \u010di hne\u010f od mali\u010dka si myslela na d\u00f4chodkov\u00fd vek, alebo kedy pri\u0161iel ten zlom? Ke\u010f si sa tomu venovala po\u010das \u0161t\u00fadia?"], [0, "U m\u0148a ten zlom polo m\u0148a pri\u0161iel pr\u00e1ve po t\u00fdch majstrostv\u00e1ch sveta, ke\u010f som mala 17, lebo naozaj t\u00e1 pr\u00edprava bola tvrd\u00e1. Napr\u00edklad str\u00e1tila som posledn\u00e9 mesiace aj men\u0161tru\u00e1ciu, \u017ee naozaj to nen\u00ed preto telo, nie je to vhodn\u00e9 ni\u010d dlhodobo takto robi\u0165, nie\u010do na takejto vrcholovej \u00farovni."], [0, "A my napr\u00edklad, lebo ja som robila akrobatick\u00e9 fitness, tam je teda jedna discipl\u00edna pozovanie, druh\u00e1 je vo\u013en\u00e1 zostava gymnastick\u00e1. A t\u00fa gymnastick\u00fa zostavu, tie salta a tak, rob\u00edme na tvrdej zemi. N\u00e1m tam ned\u00e1vaj\u00fa proste \u017eiadne, ja neviem, tatami, \u017einienky, ni\u010d. A u\u017e som si povedala, \u017ee tak to asi \u00faplne nejde \u010falej, aby toto bolo nie\u010do udr\u017eate\u013en\u00e9. A ja m\u00e1m napr\u00edklad aj skoli\u00f3zu, \u010di\u017ee sa to tak v\u0161etko..."], [0, "spolu pozliepalo a povedla som si, \u017ee dobr\u00e9, \u017ee asi zd\u00e1m proste od s\u00fa\u0165a\u017eenia pauzu a ak to niekedy m\u00e1 pri, \u017ee e\u0161te budem chce\u0165 s\u00fa\u0165a\u017ei\u0165, tak p\u00f4jdem, ale \u017ee na teraz som spokojen\u00e1 takto a ja som napr\u00edklad ve\u013emi rada, \u017ee mus\u00edm si zaklopa\u0165, \u017ee ma ni\u010d nebol\u00ed, \u017ee mi nezostali nejak\u00e9 n\u00e1sledky, lebo moje kolegynky, \u010do pozn\u00e1m, tak \u010di u\u017e schrb\u00e1 tom probl\u00e9m so zapestiami, s \u010dlenkami, tak\u017ee som naozaj rada, \u017ee mysl\u00edm si, \u017ee vrcholovo som to prestal robi\u0165 presne prav\u00fd \u010das, \u017ee nem\u00e1m nejak\u00e9 n\u00e1sledky z toho."], [0, "Si i\u0161la do d\u00f4chodkov\u00e9ho. \u00c1no, \u00faplne najlep\u0161om \u010dasu. Ke\u010f si u\u017e na\u010drtla, \u017ee si tam mala aj probl\u00e9my, pr\u00e1ve nazvime to \u017eensk\u00e9 probl\u00e9my, tam hralo rolu to, \u017ee si mala aj mal\u00e9 percento tuku? Ur\u010dite, samozrejme. Pod\u013ea m\u0148a hlavne s t\u00fdm, \u017ee si dlhodobo v kalorickom deficite, tie tr\u00e9ningy s\u00fa tvrd\u00e9, \u010di\u017ee to telo reaguje na to, \u017ee strati vlastne tak\u00fato prirodzen\u00fa vec."], [0, "Tam naozaj, \u017ee to percento tuku sa dr\u017e\u00ed na minime, tvoje \u010d\u00edslo bolo ak\u00e9, pam\u00e4t\u00e1 si e\u0161te? Nebola som na tom meran\u00ed, naozaj neviem, ale vlastne schudla som z 56 k\u00fdl na 51 a teda tam u\u017e naozaj to percento tuku, neviem presne ak\u00e9 to je, ke\u010f s\u00fa \u0165a\u017eia \u017eeny, \u017ee ak\u00e9 to je na tom meran\u00ed, ale ako je ve\u013emi n\u00edzke, no ani to ni\u010d dlhodobo udr\u017eate\u013en\u00e9."], [0, "Ty si tam e\u0161te musela vlastne okrem toho pouzovania, e\u0161te si tam mala nejak\u00fa choreografiu. \u00c1no, vlastne tam m\u00e1\u0161 t\u00fa choreografiu a je to naozaj ve\u013emi n\u00e1ro\u010dn\u00e9, lebo napr\u00edklad bikini fitness, mne sa to ve\u013emi p\u00e1\u010di, ale oni to maj\u00fa ako\u017ee \u013eah\u0161ie napr\u00edklad ove\u013ea s t\u00fdm, \u017ee aj ke\u010f nepij\u00fa, ako aj my, u\u017e je tam proste to manipulovanie s tou vodou, st\u00e1le je to iba pouzovanie, \u017ee prejd\u00fa sa, uk\u00e1\u017eu tie svaly, uk\u00e1\u017eu t\u00fa formu, ale ty, jak si v stojke, jak rob\u00ed\u0161 tie salte, ty st\u00e1le mus\u00ed\u0161"]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["News & Politics"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["physiotherapy", "injury prevention", "strength training", "exercise technique", "joint health", "progressive overload", "competitive fitness", "gymnastics routine", "body fat", "calorie deficit", "amenorrhea", "scoliosis", "sports medicine", "nutrition", "bodybuilding", "performance pressure", "aging", "rehabilitation"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
