dline, Trump, Whitmer, and the Problem of Emergency Powers. To have a picture of Governor Whitmer and President Donald Trump side by side, like sharing a problem together, that's pretty amazing in itself. Meanwhile, speaking of the president and the governor,"], [0, "Governor Whitmer was able to go to Trump and get him to okay the ice storm aid that FEMA Everybody loves FEMA FEMA turned down"], [0, "FEMA turned down the aid, and somehow or another, Governor Whitmer was able to weasel it out of Donald Trump. And I got a sidebar story on my desk. I can't find it because it's my desk. But there's a story about President Trump is helping..."], [0, "Block invasive Asian carp from reaching the Great Lakes. I don't know if you saw that sidebar story. I saw his post about it, and he's pretty fired up about blocking Asian carp. Did he say anything like, just one Asian carp comes into the Great Lakes, and they will see hooks and spears like never before? We will hit the Asian carp unlike anything you've ever seen."], [0, "Okay. So, you know, the best way to handle Asian carp is change the name of it and make it a delicacy on menus. Right. Man, we'll fish them out of existence, like we almost did with sea bass. Let's get Joe Vacari on the phone and get it on the menu. Joe knows what to do with fish. Nobody does fish better than Joe and Vacari and Joe Muir. Your country and the Great Lakes need you."]], "participants": []}, "input_categories": ["News & Politics"]}, "prompt_chain": [{"step": 0, "id": "12346546888", "crc": 1321321, "title": "Infer tags from a conversation window", "name": "infer_tags_from_a_conversation_window", "description": "Returns tags representing the conversation as a whole from the window received.", "type": "inference", "input_path": "conversation", "prompt_template": "Analyze conversation in terms of topic interests of the participants. Analyze the conversation (provided in structured XML format) where <p0> has the questions and <p1> has the answers. Return comma-delimited tags. Only return the tags without any English commentary.", "output_variable": "final_output", "output_type": "List[str]"}], "example_output": {"tags": ["guitar", "barn", "farm", "nashville"], "type": "List[str]"}}, "result": {"tags": ["media bias", "mainstream news", "trump presidency", "ship attacks", "strait of hormuz", "iran tensions", "military threats", "syria red line", "emergency powers", "governor whitmer", "fema disaster aid", "asian carp", "great lakes", "public policy", "political narrative", "crisis communication", "fisheries management", "restaurant industry"], "vectors": null}, "error": null}
